WEBVTT

00:00:00.351 --> 00:00:07.863
Cards can be connected directly on the canvas. A dot appears as the pointer approaches it or the card edge, and matches the card’s colour.

00:00:08.843 --> 00:00:17.283
Click a dot and the ghost arrow follows the pointer. It snaps and highlights the target only when the pointer reaches the card or comes very close. Click again to connect them.

00:00:18.275 --> 00:00:25.404
The arrow points from the prerequisite to the card that waits. When the second card is started, it stays in the queue until the first is finished.

00:00:26.378 --> 00:00:34.041
Hover over a manual arrow to reveal its trash button. Confirming removal releases that wait. Existing inferred waits keep their own controls.

00:00:34.999 --> 00:00:40.607
Projects and their workstreams do not offer manual connection dots. Their ordering is decided from the plan.
